cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Primr in your research or work, please cite it as below."
title: Primr
abstract: >-
  Turn any company or organization URL into a sourced strategic intelligence
  brief. Primr is a CLI-first, local-first LLM-API client, adaptive scraper, and
  MCP/A2A agent that triangulates DNS recon, hiring signals, the site corpus, and
  external research into a long-form strategic analysis with confidence labels.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Seal
    given-names: Nick
repository-code: "https://github.com/blisspixel/primr"
url: "https://github.com/blisspixel/primr"
license: Apache-2.0
# NOTE: `version` is pinned to the single source of version truth by
# tests/test_release_integrity.py - bump it together with pyproject.toml,
# primr.__version__, and the ROADMAP "Current State" line.
version: 1.36.0
date-released: "2026-07-18"
keywords:
  - company-research
  - strategic-analysis
  - competitive-intelligence
  - large-language-models
  - web-scraping
  - mcp-server
  - autonomous-research
